<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NETWORK STILL IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</title>
<headline>NETWORK STILL IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Healthcare Holdings Ltd said on Monday that it was still in talks which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders should continue to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
